  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve finally done it...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049201900760065002000660069006E0061006C006C007900200064006F006E0065002000690074002E002E002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They said it couldn’t be done, but I did it. For the\nsake of our customers, I really went and did it.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You may know of the ultimate beans we use in\nour Ultimo Coffee, AKA the <U+E300>100,000 brew.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWell, I have obtained the ultimate grade of the\nultimate beans—the supreme cream of the crop.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 188
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They can only be harvested in a select area. And\nonly a handful are produced at a time.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But thanks to the power of Pokémon, I finally got\nthem: the ultimate beans of supreme ultimacy!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is the achievement of a lifetime.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000690073002000740068006500200061006300680069006500760065006D0065006E00740020006F0066002000610020006C00690066006500740069006D0065002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wouldn’t you like a taste of my once-in-a-lifetime\nbrew?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006F0075006C0064006E2019007400200079006F00750020006C0069006B0065002000610020007400610073007400650020006F00660020006D00790020006F006E00630065002D0069006E002D0061002D006C00690066006500740069006D0065000A0062007200650077003F00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I sure would",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300750072006500200077006F0075006C00640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I think I’m good",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007400680069006E006B002000492019006D00200067006F006F00640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hrm. I suppose you do seem better suited to a\npedestrian cup of <U+E300>100,000 brew.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then prepare to pay the price. It’ll cost you\n<U+E300>1,000,000.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680065006E0020007000720065007000610072006500200074006F00200070006100790020007400680065002000700072006900630065002E0020004900742019006C006C00200063006F0073007400200079006F0075000AE3000031002C003000300030002C003000300030002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you truly are interested—and you’re sure you\nwon’t regret it—then go on. Order a cup.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The ultimate beans of supreme ultimacy. This kind\nof chance only comes around once in a lifetime.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHave you come to partake of my ultimate special?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmph. I suppose you do seem better suited to a\npedestrian cup of <U+E300>100,000 brew.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmph. Can’t even scrape together <U+E300>1,000,000?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou DO seem better suited to a pedestrian cup of\n<U+E300>100,000 brew.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 116
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re absolutely sure?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou really believe you’re worthy of a cup of\n<U+E300>1,000,000 brew?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou think this is a good use of all your savings?\nAnd you’ll be able to appreciate this brew’s taste?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 198
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know that appreciating such a rare bean is\nabout more than merely tasting the difference.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt’s about understanding the bean itself.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nKnowing how it was grown. How it was roasted.\nWhen. Where. Why.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd still you insist that you can appreciate a\n<U+E300>1,000,000 cup of coffee?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 286
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I do",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nope",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007000650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And can you express the unique notes of such a\nbean—describe its flavor in your own words?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMerely saying that it tastes like a <U+E300>1,000,000 cup\nof coffee won’t cut it. That relates nothing.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nNothing at all. Such words are dregs in my mug.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou’re sure you aren’t merely chasing after some\nshallow desire for notoriety?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou aren’t here just so you can boast—plebe that\nyou are—that you’ve tasted a <U+E300>1,000,000 brew?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 426
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want to drink the coffee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 4768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E007400200074006F0020006400720069006E006B002000740068006500200063006F006600660065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This can’t be worth it",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 4824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800690073002000630061006E2019007400200062006500200077006F0072007400680020006900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So, you’ll fork over <U+E300>1,000,000 of your hard-\nearned cash.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThen you’ll spew out some ignorant commentary\nabout the flavor and simply embarrass yourself.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nThe shame will never leave you.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou realize what’s at stake, don’t you? And yet\nyou claim to be ready for the ultimate special—<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nthe ultimate coffee of supreme ultimacy?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 338
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I want the blasted coffee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 5548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770061006E0074002000740068006500200062006C0061007300740065006400200063006F006600660065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nothing can be worth this",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 5604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400680069006E0067002000630061006E00200062006500200077006F007200740068002000740068006900730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Then allow me to confirm just one last time...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou wish to drink a cup of my ultimate special—a\nbrew so rare it can be had but once in a lifetime?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou seek the ultimate coffee of supreme ultimacy?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 5656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 207
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just sell me the dang coffee!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 6072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A007500730074002000730065006C006C0020006D00650020007400680065002000640061006E006700200063006F006600660065006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s it—I’m so done with you",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 6132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061007420190073002000690074201400492019006D00200073006F00200064006F006E00650020007700690074006800200079006F00750000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Such determination... Now THAT is worthy of my\nonce-in-a-lifetime special. That is what deserves<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na cup of the ultimate coffee of supreme ultimacy.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 6196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 154
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I ask forgiveness for testing your resolve so\nrelentlessly.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 6504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000610073006B00200066006F00720067006900760065006E00650073007300200066006F0072002000740065007300740069006E006700200079006F007500720020007200650073006F006C0076006500200073006F000A00720065006C0065006E0074006C006500730073006C0079002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I will prepare your coffee at once. Please have a\nseat and relax.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 6632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000770069006C006C0020007000720065007000610072006500200079006F0075007200200063006F00660066006500650020006100740020006F006E00630065002E00200050006C00650061007300650020006800610076006500200061000A007300650061007400200061006E0064002000720065006C00610078002E00100002011401E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Go ahead, dear customer. Try my ultimate special:\nthe ultimate coffee of supreme ultimacy.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 6772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "All right...bottoms up!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 6964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C002000720069006700680074002E002E002E0062006F00740074006F006D007300200075007000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wait...let me take it in",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 7012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006100690074002E002E002E006C006500740020006D0065002000740061006B006500200069007400200069006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That, dear customer, was a cup brewed from the\nultimate beans of supreme ultimacy.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMy ultimate special—a once-in-a-lifetime delicacy.\nAnd how would you describe the flavor?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 7064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 180
    },
    {
      "displayText": "An experience of joy that dims all others",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 7424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E00200065007800700065007200690065006E006300650020006F00660020006A006F007900200074006800610074002000640069006D007300200061006C006C0020006F007400680065007200730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The ultimate in aroma and aftertaste",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 7508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006500200075006C00740069006D00610074006500200069006E002000610072006F006D006100200061006E0064002000610066007400650072007400610073007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Truly a once-in-a-millennium flavor",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 7584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400720075006C0079002000610020006F006E00630065002D0069006E002D0061002D006D0069006C006C0065006E006E00690075006D00200066006C00610076006F00720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pretty normal, I guess?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 7656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050007200650074007400790020006E006F0072006D0061006C002C00200049002000670075006500730073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yes. And discovering that for yourself is surely a\n<U+E300>1,000,000 experience.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 7704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you for your lovely words. They are most\nworthy of a <U+E300>1,000,000 cup of coffee.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And now, the matter of the bill. That will be\n<U+E300>1,000,000, if you please.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 8040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I imagine the ultimate beans must be glad to have\nbeen consumed by the ultimate Trainer.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǠ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 8196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    }
  ],
